        "quote": "\ud83d\ude4f\ud83c\udffe\n\n\nAlex Triantafilou \ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8\ud83d\udc18\ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8 (@ChairmanAlex)\n\nOhio lost a giant of a man last week with the passing of former Senator Jim Carnes. Senator Carnes was a strong Republican and I was honored to get to kno",
